---
description: >-
  classDiagram with namespaces nested via brace syntax (namespace Platform containing
  namespace Auth and namespace Data) rather than dot notation, plus a class relating into
  each nested namespace.
---
classDiagram
  namespace Platform {
  namespace Auth {
    class UserService {
      +login()
      +logout()
    }
  }
  namespace Data {
    class Repository {
      +find()
      +save()
    }
  }
  class Gateway {
    +route()
  }
  }
  Gateway --> UserService : delegates
  Gateway --> Repository : delegates
